 "language_probability": 0.965755820274353,
 "text": "I know I cannot be the only one who uses their phone as a flashlight until it dies. Then you're in a dark parking lot with no light and no phone. This is a flashlight and a power bank, and it clips right onto your keys. Press the orange button for a beam you can focus. Hang it up, and the side light works like a camping light. Phone dying? Plug it in. It recharges with USB-C, same as your phone. My only complaint, everybody who sees it is going to want one. The clocks go back November 1st, so it's dark before dinner. Grab one for your keys and one for your mom's car. It's in the orange cart.",
